    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/extras/c0703b7ddc5d74e14aae543a837c8e48.avif?t=1744628782\" data-has-big width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Potat</strong> is a quirky, physics-based 3D adventure where you play as a sentient potato trying to escape a house before you get cooked alive. Roll, flip, and flop your way through a bizarre home filled with deadly traps, chaotic layouts, and unexpected obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal? Make it out of the house, reach the backyard, bury yourself in the soil, and fulfill your true destiny: becoming a full-fledged potato plant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The root of all chaos starts with you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/extras/9c82e337b7fcc17cf68d431ca6719978.avif?t=1744628782\" data-has-big width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go on a wild adventure by rolling through the house, flipping over tight spaces, and finding creative ways to navigate areas too small for a normal escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/extras/e449631522775df5058d4eacf4b37c1c.poster.avif?t=1744628782\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/extras/e449631522775df5058d4eacf4b37c1c.webm?t=1744628782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/extras/e449631522775df5058d4eacf4b37c1c.mp4?t=1744628782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/extras/67b3a983a5b48c84e513ed9f47c388d5.avif?t=1744628782\" data-has-big width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whoever placed objects in this house clearly wasn\u2019t thinking straight! Use the bizarre layout to your advantage\u2014navigate through the chaotic layout to escape and be reborn outside!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/extras/29acf3d38123c90b8880ffaee61349be.poster.avif?t=1744628782\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/extras/29acf3d38123c90b8880ffaee61349be.webm?t=1744628782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/extras/29acf3d38123c90b8880ffaee61349be.mp4?t=1744628782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/extras/818255c164a6ade6eba51615ece27b7b.avif?t=1744628782\" data-has-big width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyday household items are a nightmare for our sentient potato. From sharp knives to bouncy sponges, dodge dangerous obstacles and move with care\u2014one wrong step and you\u2019re mashed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/extras/c05ec9eee223e5b5724adea5b64d504d.poster.avif?t=1744628782\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/extras/c05ec9eee223e5b5724adea5b64d504d.webm?t=1744628782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/extras/c05ec9eee223e5b5724adea5b64d504d.mp4?t=1744628782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/extras/c0703b7ddc5d74e14aae543a837c8e48.avif?t=1744628782\" data-has-big width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Potat</strong> is a quirky, physics-based 3D adventure where you play as a sentient potato trying to escape a house before you get cooked alive. Roll, flip, and flop your way through a bizarre home filled with deadly traps, chaotic layouts, and unexpected obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal? Make it out of the house, reach the backyard, bury yourself in the soil, and fulfill your true destiny: becoming a full-fledged potato plant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The root of all chaos starts with you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/extras/9c82e337b7fcc17cf68d431ca6719978.avif?t=1744628782\" data-has-big width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go on a wild adventure by rolling through the house, flipping over tight spaces, and finding creative ways to navigate areas too small for a normal escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/extras/e449631522775df5058d4eacf4b37c1c.poster.avif?t=1744628782\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/extras/e449631522775df5058d4eacf4b37c1c.webm?t=1744628782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/extras/e449631522775df5058d4eacf4b37c1c.mp4?t=1744628782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/extras/67b3a983a5b48c84e513ed9f47c388d5.avif?t=1744628782\" data-has-big width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whoever placed objects in this house clearly wasn\u2019t thinking straight! Use the bizarre layout to your advantage\u2014navigate through the chaotic layout to escape and be reborn outside!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/extras/29acf3d38123c90b8880ffaee61349be.poster.avif?t=1744628782\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/extras/29acf3d38123c90b8880ffaee61349be.webm?t=1744628782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/extras/29acf3d38123c90b8880ffaee61349be.mp4?t=1744628782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/extras/818255c164a6ade6eba51615ece27b7b.avif?t=1744628782\" data-has-big width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyday household items are a nightmare for our sentient potato. From sharp knives to bouncy sponges, dodge dangerous obstacles and move with care\u2014one wrong step and you\u2019re mashed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/extras/c05ec9eee223e5b5724adea5b64d504d.poster.avif?t=1744628782\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/extras/c05ec9eee223e5b5724adea5b64d504d.webm?t